---
import Florals from './Florals.astro';
const photos = [
{src:'/images/seoul-garden.png',alt:'Pasangan pengantin berjalan bersama di taman bunga',caption:'01 — a little walk, a lifetime together'},
{src:'/images/seoul-couple.png',alt:'Potret pengantin di studio dengan cahaya lembut',caption:'02 — our favorite kind of quiet'},
{src:'/images/seoul-closeup.png',alt:'Momen romantis pasangan pengantin dengan buket tulip',caption:'03 — all the little things, with you'}
];
---
<section id="gallery" class="story-section gallery-section reveal"><Florals class="gallery-flower"/><div class="section-label"><span>02 / OUR LITTLE MOMENTS</span><span>COLLECTING MEMORIES</span></div><div class="section-heading"><span class="handwritten"><span class="ink-text">a few frames of us</span></span><h2>Cerita dalam <em>gambar.</em></h2><p>Hal-hal kecil yang ingin kami kenang selamanya.</p></div><div class="gallery-grid">{photos.map((photo) => <figure><button class="gallery-photo" data-photo={photo.src} data-caption={photo.alt} aria-label={`Perbesar foto: ${photo.alt}`}><img src={photo.src} alt={photo.alt} loading="lazy" width="1086" height="1448"/><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><figcaption>{photo.caption}</figcaption></figure>)}</div></section>
<section id="rsvp" class="story-section rsvp-section reveal"><Florals class="section-flower"/><div class="section-label"><span>03 / SAVE YOU A SEAT</span><span>BERSAMA ORANG TERSAYANG</span></div><div class="guest-layout"><div class="section-heading"><span class="handwritten"><span class="ink-text">will you be there?</span></span><h2>Satu tempat,<br/>untuk <em>kamu.</em></h2><p>Kehadiranmu akan melengkapi hari bahagia kami. Kabari kami melalui formulir berikut.</p><span class="local-note">Mode lokal · RSVP tersimpan di browser ini dan belum dikirim ke pasangan.</span></div><form id="rsvp-form" class="guest-form"><label>Nama lengkap<input name="guest" required maxlength="80" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Nama kamu"/></label><fieldset><legend>Apakah kamu akan hadir?</legend><label class="radio-option"><input type="radio" name="attendance" value="yes" required checked/> Dengan senang hati hadir</label><label class="radio-option"><input type="radio" name="attendance" value="no"/> Maaf, belum bisa hadir</label></fieldset><label id="party-label">Jumlah tamu, termasuk kamu<select name="party"><option value="1">1 orang</option><option value="2">2 orang</option><option value="3">3 orang</option><option value="4">4 orang</option><option value="5">5 orang</option></select></label><button class="print-button" type="submit">Simpan konfirmasi <span>♡</span></button><p class="form-status" id="rsvp-status" role="status"></p></form></div><div class="attendance-record"><div><span class="eyebrow">DAFTAR KEHADIRAN LOKAL</span><p id="attendance-summary">Belum ada konfirmasi.</p></div><button id="export-rsvp" class="text-button" disabled>Unduh daftar CSV ↓</button><ul id="attendance-list" aria-label="Daftar kehadiran"></ul></div></section>
<section id="wishes" class="story-section wishes-section reveal"><div class="section-label"><span>04 / WORDS TO KEEP</span><span>A LITTLE LOVE GOES A LONG WAY</span></div><div class="section-heading"><span class="handwritten"><span class="ink-text">leave a little love</span></span><h2>Doa & <em>ucapan.</em></h2><p>Sepatah doa darimu, kenangan manis untuk kami.</p></div><div class="wishes-layout"><form id="wish-form" class="guest-form"><label>Nama kamu<input name="author" required maxlength="80" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Dari siapa ucapan ini?"/></label><label>Ucapan & doa<textarea name="wish" required minlength="3" maxlength="600" rows="4" placeholder="Tuliskan harapan terbaikmu…"></textarea></label><button class="print-button" type="submit">Simpan ucapan <span>↗</span></button><p class="local-note">Ucapan hanya tersimpan dan terlihat di browser ini.</p><p id="wish-status" class="form-status" role="status"></p></form><div id="wish-list" class="wish-list" aria-label="Ucapan tamu"><p class="empty-wishes">“Setiap doa adalah bagian<br/>dari cerita kami.”<span>Jadilah yang pertama meninggalkan ucapan ♡</span></p></div></div></section>
<section id="gift" class="story-section gift-section reveal"><Florals class="gift-flower" variant="rings"/><span class="eyebrow">05 / A TOKEN OF LOVE</span><div class="section-heading"><span class="handwritten"><span class="ink-text">your presence is our present</span></span><h2>Tanda <em>kasih.</em></h2><p>Kehadiran dan doa adalah hadiah terindah.<br/>Jika ingin berbagi tanda kasih, berikut rekening kami.</p></div><div class="bank-card"><span class="bank-label">WEDDING GIFT <span>♡</span></span><h3 data-output="bank">[NAMA BANK]</h3><p class="account-number" data-output="account">[NOMOR REKENING]</p><p class="account-holder">a.n. <span data-output="holder">[NAMA PEMILIK]</span></p><button id="copy-account" class="text-button" disabled>Salin nomor rekening ⧉</button><p id="bank-status" class="local-note" role="status">Nomor rekening belum diisi.</p></div></section>
<nav class="guest-nav" aria-label="Menu undangan"><a href="#invitation"><span>♡</span>Undangan</a><a href="#gallery"><span>▧</span>Galeri</a><a href="#rsvp"><span>✓</span>RSVP</a><a href="#wishes"><span>✎</span>Ucapan</a><a href="#gift"><span>♧</span>Hadiah</a></nav>
<dialog id="lightbox" aria-label="Foto pernikahan diperbesar"><button class="close" id="lightbox-close" aria-label="Tutup foto">×</button><img id="lightbox-image" alt=""/><p id="lightbox-caption"></p></dialog>
